 Pacifc Relations pamphlets.\nEphemera found between pp. 100-101 : Blank order form for back documents available realting to the hearings of the Senate Judiciary Subcommittee on Internal Security.\nEphemera found between pp. 10-11 : Blank order form for Mao's China: Party Reform Documents, 1942-1944 by Boyd Compton.\nEphemera found between pp. 48-49 : Statements on the Institute of Pacific Relations : presented to the Senate Judiciary Subcommitte on Internal Security at a public hearing in Washington, D.C., March 19, 1952.\nEphemera found between pp. 64-65 : Blank order form for Geography of Korea by V.T. Zaichikov.\nEphemera : originally housed in file folder labeled by Georgia O'Keeffe : Sweeney / Far Eastern Survey.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nFortnightly research service.\nTitle from caption.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}